<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Mumbai to Goa | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the key factors affecting bike transport costs from Mumbai to Goa?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The costs of bike transport from Mumbai to Goa are influenced by several factors, including the type of bike, the distance of approximately 850 km, the chosen transport method, and any additional services such as packing and insurance. Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers provides transparent pricing to help customers understand these factors.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers ensure the safety of my bike during transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers employs a 5-step safety workflow, which includes thorough inspections, 7-layer shock-absorbent packaging, careful loading onto hydraulic ramp trailers, real-time tracking during transit, and meticulous delivery procedures to ensure your bike arrives safely in Goa.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What types of vehicles are used for bike transport from Mumbai to Goa?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We utilize specialized container trucks with hydraulic ramps for bike transport from Mumbai to Goa. Our fleet includes 18ft, 22ft, and 32ft trucks, ensuring that your bike is securely transported in enclosed trailers designed to prevent damage during transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there insurance coverage for my bike during transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers offers 100% declared-value IRDAI-approved marine transit insurance for your bike during transport. This ensures that you are financially protected in the unlikely event of any damage or loss during the relocation process.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike during the transport process?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely! We provide satellite GPS live tracking for all our bike transport services. This allows you to monitor the real-time location of your bike as it travels from Mumbai to Goa, giving you peace of mind throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the estimated transit time for bike transport from Mumbai to Goa?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The estimated transit time for bike transport from Mumbai to Goa is typically around 3 to 5 days, depending on traffic conditions and the specific route taken. Our team works diligently to ensure timely delivery while maintaining safety standards.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How do I prepare my bike for transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To prepare your bike for transport, ensure it is clean and in good working condition. Remove any personal items, check the fuel level (ideally below a quarter tank), and inform our team of any specific concerns or requirements you may have regarding the transport process.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
